{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございますっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はね、何してたかと言うとねー、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お昼はみんなで練習して、\n番組の企画会議して、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜はひめたんがずっと大好き"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"な\nななちんと久々に電話しました(・∀・)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いきなりでごめんねななちん。\nほんまに話しだしたら止まらなくなっちゃって!\n結局２時間話したら真夜中になっちゃって「さすがに切ろっか」ってなったけど、\nそれまでずーっとひたすら話し続けてました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ。ちはるんるん（斎藤ちはるchan）の時みたいに、特に伝えたいことがあって電話したわけじゃないんだけどー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりーの感動で始まり\n学校のこと、\n乃木坂のこと、\nアクターのこと、\nいろんなこと話したっ(*^^*)!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アクターおるときからななちんとはよくお話ししとったけ\nいつものノリっちゃいつものノリなんだけどね\nその「いつもの」がなんか懐かしくてほっこりした(^ω^)\n最近東京でずっとバタバタしとったけど、\nななちんとお話ししてたら疲れがふっ飛びましたびゅーん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"13日にHEY!HEY!HEY!出演って書いとかないと～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"情報には疎いもので...ごめんなさい('・ω・`)←\n付け足しておきまする。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは親父ギャグを許せますか？(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやじぎゃく。可愛いと思います(o>ω<o)/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうすぐ握手会だね。ひめたんはファンの前だと緊張する方？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いざ顔みたら緊張しちゃって、話したかったことぽーんって飛んでっちゃう('・ω・`)\nんでも楽しみにしとるです!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校生になったら何したいとかある？(^^♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女子力あげる(*^^*)/\nお料理とか、お裁縫とか、特訓することにしますっ\n今よりもっとアイドルらしいアイドルになるよ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部活は入るのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"入りたいなーとか思いつつ。検討中なう＼(^ω^)／!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはMAX何時間起きてたことあるん？笑っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おーる＼(^^)／\nからの朝方爆睡したから、結果26時間とかだと思う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"突然電話するってことは1回は短いの？それとも長電話しちゃう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるんるんはいっつも会っとるけあえて話題が思い浮かばんかったけど\n基本電話しだしたら長いと思う('・ω・`)\nだからって深い話では決してないんだけれども。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはカラオケでなに歌うの！？\n意外とバラードなんだ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いわゆる、誰もが知ってる鉄板系の曲みたいな(ω)？\nいや違うのー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんの半年前まで高い声でガンガン歌うのが好きだったんぢゃけど\n最近ひめたんの音域が全体的に下がっちゃったみたいで。\n今までのレパートリーが全部だめになっちゃったんですよー。\nだから落ち着いたバラードに走ったんぢゃけど\n声が幼いのは変わらないです。\n雰囲気ー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはカラオケ中店員さんが入ってきても気にしないで歌い続けますか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌い続けるどころか、歌いながらニコってお辞儀する人(・∀・)にこ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは、アイドルになってなかったら何になってましたか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アナウンサーなりたいってずっと思ってるです(*・ω・*)♪\nちっちゃい時はぱん屋さんとかなりたかったかもしれない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ちはるんとBUMP OF CHICKENのお話した？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばんぷさんのお話はしとらんけど、バスん中で一緒に音楽聴くときは\nよくばんぷさんオススメしてもらう(*^^*)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島だと、卒業式のころには\nさくらは咲いているのかな…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎年なんだかんだできれいに咲いてくれますー♪\n今年も咲いてくれたらいいな∩^ω^∩\nそんでもって入学式まで持ってくれたらなお嬉しいなー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！ひめたん中学卒業だった。桜まだ咲いてない…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななちんによると、ひめたんにだいぶ標準語が混ざりつつあるらしい...。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(`・ω・')!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}